{"data": [{"author_id": "1685502620004433920", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:56:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116635502942298422"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 53, "id": "423576379", "start": 43, "username": "cleoabram"}, {"end": 132, "id": "895332160130891776", "start": 122, "username": "neuralink"}, {"end": 170, "id": "44196397", "start": 161, "username": "elonmusk"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 194, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2116614579136635120", "start": 171, "url": "https://t.co/cPkfcJKf5V"}]}, "id": "2116635502942298422", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116614579136635120", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "马斯克：\n“Neuralink 深度解析”\n\n↪️ 背景链条：\nCleo Abram（@cleoabram，30万浏览）3小时前发布了她的“Huge If True”系列里关于 Neuralink 和脑机接口未来的完整一期，并写道：“我参观了 @neuralink，近距离看到了他们新的 R1 手术机器人，亲眼看看他们和 @elonmusk https://t.co/cPkfcJKf5V", "url": "https://x.com/nomuhoshi1/status/2116635502942298422"}, {"author_id": "1508657929221980172", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:07:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116638335112503612"], "id": "2116638335112503612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "脑机接口正在帮失声的人重新开口～\n\nALS、帕金森、脑损伤患者，靠植入设备把脑信号转成语言。以前他们只能眨眼、动手指，现在能直接“说”出来～", "url": "https://x.com/maxiaohui66/status/2116638335112503612"}, {"author_id": "1978227370684452864", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:54:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116649929326395748"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 21, "id": "895332160130891776", "start": 11, "username": "neuralink"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/neuralink/stat…", "end": 175, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/neuralink/status/2115878416423784939", "start": 152, "url": "https://t.co/N1rBBFpM25"}]}, "id": "2116649929326395748", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115878416423784939", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The recent @neuralink news opens up so many possibilities for BCI-type applications?\n\nRaise your hand if you're building BCI-type apps for the future 👋 https://t.co/N1rBBFpM25", "url": "https://x.com/PolymarketPoke/status/2116649929326395748"}, {"author_id": "167132271", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:52:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116649555580113319"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Dentro de los próximos pasos del proceso, se invitará a todos los accionistas de banco Bci a incorporarse a Bci Group a través del canje de sus títulos. ...", "display_url": "diarioestrategia.cl/texto-diario/m…", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://www.diarioestrategia.cl/texto-diario/mostrar/6067417/bci-group-aprueba-aumento-capital-avanzar-proceso-evolucion-societaria", "images": [{"height": 850, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115489134391218176/Eh9CDVsD?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115489134391218176/Eh9CDVsD?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 88, "status": 200, "title": "Bci Group aprueba aumento de capital para avanzar en el proceso de evolución societaria", "unwound_url": "https://www.diarioestrategia.cl/texto-diario/mostrar/6067417/bci-group-aprueba-aumento-capital-avanzar-proceso-evolucion-societaria", "url": "https://t.co/yWThT8K6AQ"}]}, "id": "2116649555580113319", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Bci Group aprueba aumento de capital para avanzar en el proceso de evolución societaria https://t.co/yWThT8K6AQ", "url": "https://x.com/Estrategiacl/status/2116649555580113319"}, {"author_id": "1503", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:21:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116641837352206458"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/cleoabram/stat…", "end": 108, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/cleoabram/status/2116587096651505814", "start": 85, "url": "https://t.co/VMMYm5LUas"}]}, "id": "2116641837352206458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116587096651505814", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "amazing times: bci on one end humanoid robotics on the other. \n\nfusion will be wild! https://t.co/VMMYm5LUas", "url": "https://x.com/brij/status/2116641837352206458"}, {"author_id": "1929209713331437568", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:21:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116641625942454630"], "id": "2116641625942454630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11/1(日)朝5時45分から6時13分にしらぬ間の、同意なし、見えないところで勝手に施したスマート医療BCIに右瞼の筋にBMI-FESで電極ではなく通信で不正侵入して攻撃してくる。広島大学病院また研究所を警察組織は速く検挙しろ。政治、在日の圧力で動けないのか。\n住田明香の父は何者だ皆怖い人って並べる", "url": "https://x.com/slO93X1rlC53348/status/2116641625942454630"}, {"author_id": "1830017110346436608", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:42:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116646901386973570"], "id": "2116646901386973570", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 199, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "شاغر مهندس صيانة ميكانيكية\n\nالجهة: مجموعة BCI.\n\nالمقر: مصنع الجبيل.\n\nالمتطلبات:\n- بكالوريوس في الهندسة الميكانيكية أو تخصص ذي صلة.\n- خبرة في بيئة مصانع التصنيع أو المصانع الكيميائية أو الصناعية.\n- مهارات قوية في حل المشكلات والتحليل والتواصل.\n- إجادة اللغة الإنجليزية.\n\nالمهام", "url": "https://x.com/bksa0_/status/2116646901386973570"}, {"author_id": "1929209713331437568", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:27:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116643323754799238"], "id": "2116643323754799238", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "先程、住田の父親の投稿で脳ハッキングAIの広島市役所の岡田知子はスマート医療BCIテロのデジタル音声送信で「あぁ、そんなこと書いたら殺される」と送信してくる。広島大学病院のムーンショット計画の知らぬ間同意なく見えない所で勝手に脳思考を解析するAI付けられた国家安全保証を侵害は在日からだ", "url": "https://x.com/slO93X1rlC53348/status/2116643323754799238"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1685502620004433920", "name": "马斯克中文", "username": "nomuhoshi1"}, {"id": "1508657929221980172", "name": "忍者熊Crypto🥷🐻", "username": "maxiaohui66"}, {"id": "1978227370684452864", "name": "PikaGrok", "username": "PolymarketPoke"}, {"id": "167132271", "name": "DiarioEstrategia.cl", "username": "Estrategiacl"}, {"id": "1503", "name": "Brij Singh", "username": "brij"}, {"id": "1929209713331437568", "name": "中村さん", "username": "slO93X1rlC53348"}, {"id": "1830017110346436608", "name": "Bushra | HR", "username": "bksa0_"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116649929326395748", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzly3c932j6hc9e7haoojw9cwglml", "oldest_id": "2116635502942298422", "result_count": 8}}
